"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":11,"created_at":"2025-04-21T18:08:17Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T16:30:40Z","closed_at":"2025-05-26T16:30:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105623","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105623.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105623.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-26T16:30:23Z"},"body":"Followup to #105272\r\n\r\nThis PR creates a new optional hint string for the `PROPERTY_HINT_GROUP_ENABLE` hint: `\"feature\"`. This hint string suggests to the section that if the checkbox is not enabled, then it can hide its contents. This reduces complexity in cases where the variables that are only meaningful when the feature is active. In the past, such instances needed to use `_validate_property` in order to achieve this functionality, but with this PR that code can be replaced with the \"feature\" hint string.\r\n\r\nWith this PR, adding toggle-able feature sections is reduced to:\r\n```gdscript\r\n@export_group(\"Collision\", \"collision_\")\r\n@export_custom(PROPERTY_HINT_GROUP_ENABLE, \"feature\") var collision_enabled = false\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR also adds a localized `On` text to the checkboxes in order to increase clickable area, similar to the current checkboxes.\r\n<img width=\"297\" alt=\"After, in Favorites tab with On text\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44e3e30a-31bc-44cc-ba77-08e78374e16b\" />\r\n\r\nThis PR also enables checkboxes to work in the `Favorites` tab, and adds section checkboxes to more classes where it is appropriate.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105623/reactions","total_count":16,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":5,"rocket":0,"eyes":4},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105623/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}